<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Germi</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The germi were the nobility in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/wolof">Wolof</a> society of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jolof-empire">Jolof Empire</a>. They formed the highest stratum of a society structured by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caste">caste</a>, occupation and lineage, above free commoners, artisan castes and the enslaved.</p></div>
